{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is visible, move to it, grab it, check properties, do task. Otherwise, scan or move randomly.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = RandomMove    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
